{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"深圳APEC｜白宮公布特朗普周四先晤習近平　之後舉行美中俄三方會談\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APEC-TRUMP-261116-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】白宮公布總統特朗普到深圳參加亞太經合組織會議的行程。</p><p>白宮表示，特朗普在菲律賓完成行程後，預計在周三轉抵深圳，並在周四早上出席APEC領導人全體會議，之後在麒麟山莊先與國家主席習近平雙邊會晤，之後再連同俄羅斯總統普京舉行三方會議。結束後，特朗普就會離開深圳，返回白宮。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T07:54:31.666617+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:10:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T21:57:14.783200+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T07:48:11.037350+00:00","content_hash":"970aa991351a94181e59d1349f2264dba4b7e90bb590e2c76f130f982d2cf107","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T07:54:31.666617+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}